# Module "workstation" (docs/layers.md, docs/fedora.md): virtual machines, the userland box, backups
# and the user's tools. podman is in fedora-bootc.
# libvirt split as on Arch (Arch: libvirt qemu-base qemu-hw-display-{qxl,virtio-vga,virtio-gpu}
# qemu-ui-spice-app qemu-audio-spice): the QEMU driver and the default network (dnsmasq), not
# libvirt-daemon-kvm, which pulls every QEMU device and storage driver
libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu libvirt-daemon-config-network libvirt-client qemu-kvm-core qemu-img
qemu-device-display-qxl qemu-device-display-virtio-vga qemu-device-display-virtio-gpu
qemu-ui-spice-app qemu-audio-spice edk2-ovmf dnsmasq virtiofsd
distrobox btrbk pass stow
